  @boundary
  Scenario: Inbound conversation history on the request payload is ignored
    Given Rich sends a chat request whose payload carries a conversation history block
    When Jarvis receives the chat request
    Then the supervisor should answer using only the Jarvis-side session history
    And the inbound conversation history block should not have leaked into the supervisor's prompt

